    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d542">

                <pb facs="0706" n="610" xml:id="pg610"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">819.51A/4: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Panama</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Price</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-03-16T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 16,
                                1921—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>29. Please refer to Department’s cables No. 13 of February 24, 6 p.m. and No. 14
                    of February 25, 7 p.m.<anchor n="8" xml:id="d542-f1"/> Department desires that
                    you press this matter with all the insistence consistent with courtesy and
                    report by cable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
